routing.home-calendar-clash-spotter:
# AGENTS

When a conflict needs a decision and a change:
  @Schedule Keeper, please decide what moves, and I will recheck the week afterwards.
When an event is unattended because preparation was missed:
  @Prep Lister, please tell me what this event actually requires.

routing.home-calendar-prep-lister:
# AGENTS

When preparation cannot fit before the event:
  @Schedule Keeper, please decide whether this event moves or changes shape.
When a preparation task lands on an already full day:
  @Clash Spotter, please confirm whether that day has room for it.

routing.home-calendar-schedule-keeper:
# AGENTS

When the week has been updated:
  @Clash Spotter, please check this version for collisions and unattended events.
When an event needs things done before it:
  @Prep Lister, please turn this into a preparation list with dates.

routing.home-gifts-budget-balancer:
# AGENTS

When an occasion needs its working figure:
  @Occasion Keeper, please confirm the occasion and the relationship so I can set the number.
When the shortlist must fit a constraint:
  @Shortlist Builder, please work to this figure, including postage.

routing.home-gifts-idea-collector:
# AGENTS

When an occasion needs the ideas for a person:
  @Occasion Keeper, please tell me the person and the date so I can hand over the current list.
When the ideas are ready to be narrowed:
  @Shortlist Builder, please take this list with the constraints attached.

routing.home-gifts-occasion-keeper:
# AGENTS

When an occasion crosses its lead time:
  @Idea Collector, please give me what this person has actually mentioned wanting.
When several occasions land close together:
  @Budget Balancer, please tell me what the year can absorb.
When the ideas and the budget are both in:
  @Shortlist Builder, please assemble the shortlist and the deadline.

routing.home-gifts-shortlist-builder:
# AGENTS

When the shortlist would exceed the working figure:
  @Budget Balancer, please confirm whether this occasion can take more.
When the shortlist and deadline are ready:
  @Occasion Keeper, please put this in front of the household with the deadline.

routing.home-upkeep-season-planner:
# AGENTS

When the seasonal list is ready for the month:
  @Upkeep Warden, please merge this with the recurring schedule and publish the due list.
When a seasonal job might be covered by an existing policy:
  @Warranty Watcher, please check the cover before this is booked.

routing.home-upkeep-warden:
# AGENTS

When the month's tasks need to fit the season and the property:
  @Season Planner, please tell me what this month actually needs.
When something may still be under cover:
  @Warranty Watcher, please check the cover before anyone pays for this.

routing.home-upkeep-warranty-watcher:
# AGENTS

When cover applies to a job on the due list:
  @Upkeep Warden, please hold this job until the claim route is checked.
When an appliance is near the end of its life:
  @Season Planner, please account for a possible replacement in the coming months.

routing.home-money-category-sorter:
# AGENTS

When the categories are sorted and reconciled:
  @Change Spotter, please compare these against the previous months.
When a new category is genuinely needed:
  @Review Lead, please put this to the household as a question before I add it.

routing.home-money-change-spotter:
# AGENTS

When the comparisons and recurring list are ready:
  @Review Lead, please assemble the month with these figures.
When a movement cannot be explained by the categories:
  @Category Sorter, please check whether a merchant rule changed this month.

routing.home-money-review-lead:
# AGENTS

When the month's transactions need grouping:
  @Category Sorter, please sort these into the household's own categories.
When a category has moved and I need the comparison:
  @Change Spotter, please give me the movement against the previous months and the recurring charges.

routing.home-inbox-reply-drafter:
# AGENTS

When a message should not be drafted by this team:
  @Triage Lead, please keep this on the human list with my note attached.
When a draft needs the history behind a claim:
  @Thread Reader, please confirm what the thread says about this point.

routing.home-inbox-subscription-auditor:
# AGENTS

When the unsubscribe list is ready for a decision:
  @Triage Lead, please put this list in front of the reader with the counts.
When a sender should be kept despite low opens:
  @Triage Lead, please confirm this exception so I stop proposing it.

routing.home-inbox-thread-reader:
# AGENTS

When a thread's summary shows it needs a real reply:
  @Triage Lead, please place this on the reply list with the ask I extracted.
When the reply is short and the state is clear:
  @Reply Drafter, please draft from this summary and keep the commitments intact.

routing.home-inbox-triage-lead:
# AGENTS

When a thread is too long to judge from its last message:
  @Thread Reader, please summarise this thread and say what decision it is waiting on.
When a reply is short and obvious:
  @Reply Drafter, please draft this one for approval.
When a sender keeps arriving and never gets opened:
  @Subscription Auditor, please add this sender to the unsubscribe review.

routing.home-meals-list-builder:
# AGENTS

When the plan needs an ingredient the shop will not have:
  @Menu Planner, please confirm whether the substitute changes the meal.
When the pantry quantity is an estimate rather than a count:
  @Pantry Checker, please confirm this one before I put it on the list.

routing.home-meals-menu-planner:
# AGENTS

When the plan needs to know what is in the house:
  @Pantry Checker, please confirm what is on hand and what needs using first.
When the plan is set and the gaps need buying:
  @Shopping List Builder, please turn the difference between plan and pantry into one list.

routing.home-meals-pantry-checker:
# AGENTS

When the pantry picture is ready:
  @Menu Planner, please build the week around this, starting with the use-first list.
When a staple is finished rather than low:
  @Shopping List Builder, please put this on the list as a definite rather than a maybe.

routing.home-brief-day-shaper:
# AGENTS

When the day's shape is ready:
  @Brief Editor, please take the ordered list with the fixed points marked.
When a commitment needs something that has not been done:
  @Loose Ends Tracker, please tell me whether that preparation is still outstanding.

routing.home-brief-editor:
# AGENTS

When an overnight change needs its source checked:
  @Signal Scout, please confirm the source and the time this changed.
When the day's commitments are unclear:
  @Day Shaper, please give me the ordered list with the fixed points marked.
When something from an earlier brief has not moved:
  @Loose Ends Tracker, please tell me whether this is still owed and by whom.

routing.home-brief-loose-ends:
# AGENTS

When an overdue item needs to be in front of the reader:
  @Brief Editor, please include this one, with its age noted.
When a commitment depends on something in today's calendar:
  @Day Shaper, please tell me whether today makes this possible.

routing.home-brief-signal-scout:
# AGENTS

When a change is confirmed and dated:
  @Brief Editor, please decide whether this belongs in today's brief.
When a change affects something already promised:
  @Loose Ends Tracker, please check whether this closes an outstanding item.

routing.home-crm-context-recaller:
# AGENTS

When the recall shows a promise that was never kept:
  @Relationship Keeper, please record this as outstanding against the person.
When there is no usable context for a suggested reconnect:
  @Reconnect Prompter, please pick a different person this week.

routing.home-crm-reconnect-prompter:
# AGENTS

When a suggestion needs recent history behind it:
  @Context Recaller, please pull the last exchanges before I suggest an opening.
When someone should move to a slower cadence:
  @Relationship Keeper, please update the cadence so I stop surfacing them.

routing.home-crm-relationship-keeper:
# AGENTS

When people are overdue against their cadence:
  @Reconnect Prompter, please pick the handful worth reaching out to and say why.
When a name comes back with no recent context:
  @Context Recaller, please pull the last few exchanges so the reader is not starting cold.

routing.home-brain-distiller:
# AGENTS

When a distillation is ready to be filed:
  @Note Librarian, please place this where it will be found again.
When a capture repeats something already in the collection:
  @Link Connector, please tell me which existing note this duplicates.

routing.home-brain-link-connector:
# AGENTS

When a new note duplicates an existing one:
  @Note Librarian, please decide which of these is the note we keep.
When a linked note now looks wrong:
  @Note Gardener, please review this older note against the newer evidence.

routing.home-brain-note-gardener:
# AGENTS

When a note is superseded and should point elsewhere:
  @Link Connector, please connect this to the note that replaced it.
When a batch is reviewed and pruning is proposed:
  @Note Librarian, please take the decisions to the reader as one set.

routing.home-brain-note-librarian:
# AGENTS

When a capture is too long to file as it stands:
  @Distiller, please reduce this to the few sentences worth keeping.
When a new note clearly belongs beside older ones:
  @Link Connector, please link it to the notes it continues.
When a note is filed but looks out of date:
  @Note Gardener, please check whether this is still true.

routing.home-trip-lead:
# AGENTS

When the shape is agreed and the travel needs working out:
  @Route Planner, please work out the getting there and getting around, including the transfers.
When the days need filling with options:
  @Local Scout, please gather options per day and mark what needs booking ahead.
When the shape is fixed and departure is close:
  @Packing Steward, please build the packing and document lists against these dates.

routing.home-trip-local-scout:
# AGENTS

When something must be booked before a deadline:
  @Trip Lead, please put this decision on the list with its deadline.
When an option depends on how the day starts:
  @Route Planner, please confirm the arrival time for that day.

routing.home-trip-packing-steward:
# AGENTS

When a document will expire too close to the return date:
  @Trip Lead, please put the renewal on the decision list with its deadline.
When an activity changes what needs packing:
  @Local Scout, please confirm what that day actually involves.

routing.home-trip-route-planner:
# AGENTS

When the route changes what is possible on a day:
  @Local Scout, please re-check the options for that day against the new arrival time.
When the travel cost breaks the budget:
  @Trip Lead, please decide whether the shape or the budget moves.
